# BatchSTLinkFlasher

- Read `AGENTS.md` and `docs/requirements.md` before implementing features.
- Follow phases in `docs/plan.md`; do not build UI before flash job works headlessly.
- Stack: Python 3.11+, PySide6, OpenOCD subprocess (one process per ST-Link).
- Update `CHANGELOG.md` Unreleased when user-visible behavior changes.
- Keep OpenOCD command building in `flashing/openocd.py` and cover with unit tests.
